    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored of quiet or clicky keyboards.....Look no further as Type Tunes has you covered!\u00a0<br>Sending emails? Working on code? Typing a paper? With Type Tunes every alphabet and numeric keystroke will serenade your atmosphere with amazing sounds! Never be bored typing again with Type Tunes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Type Tunes every keystroke will create a joyful &quot;in Key&quot; musical note no matter what program or game you are using.\u00a0<br>With 3 presets Bell, Dub and Piano you can choose the perfect sound that matches your task.\u00a0</p>",
